/// Quayline Freight: a dispatcher books a parcel, plans it onto a van's route and sends the route out; a
/// driver follows it stop by stop; the recipient follows it on a public page and by text. A parcel outside
/// the delivery area goes to a partner carrier. The carrier, the geocoder and the text vendor run as mocks
/// in the same stack.
